## Doctype Test Example
```python
def test_customer_validation_prevents_duplicate_email(self):
    """Test that duplicate email addresses are not allowed"""
    # Create first customer
    customer1 = frappe.get_doc(self.customer_data)
    customer1.email_id = "test@example.com"
    customer1.insert()
    
    # Try to create second customer with same email
    customer2 = frappe.get_doc(self.customer_data)
    customer2.email_id = "test@example.com"
    
    with self.assertRaises(frappe.DuplicateEntryError):
        customer2.insert()
```

